C4RC8X","text":"the cold dude","ts":"1629772188.258300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"isO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f50743b-f12b-4bf4-89f3-e3c33f27bdf2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみにシンプルに冷奴に乗せるとかもおすすめです。辣油またはごま油もちょっとたらして","ts":"1629772183.258000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XvMm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f1d8f68-877f-4540-8ff1-da2a732fd6da","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"わかる。実家で消費するときもそんな感じでした。四川とタイ・ベトナムとメキシコに偏りがち","ts":"1629772045.257300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Js4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"005f7d20-ceac-404a-83bc-0d78187315b3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"四川料理系とかタイ料理とメキシコ料理を行き来する感じになりますね、油断してるとべとべとになっちゃう","ts":"1629771767.255400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/hu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4926564-9295-4b92-a88d-e16d2ff749d4","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":":pakuchi-: 、一人暮らしで消費できる量を生で売ってないのでつらい","ts":"1629771514.254800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wcz="}]},{"client_msg_id":"db231d18-0c78-48ea-9cb2-4cbed611687e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"乾物スパイスではなく","ts":"1629771468.253800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uwn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efe181da-b662-48b0-99bb-fccc20ab2d0d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね。こないだ作ったときもfresh green pepperとか :pakuchi-: とか lemongrassなど、どちらかというと新鮮なやつを使いますね","ts":"1629771457.253300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8RtQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2958ca40-35f2-4f0d-8fae-b2d04c8c5b36","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"インドカレー、後から足すならカイエンペッパーで辛くするくらいですかね。\n煮込むときに入れるのが多い印象","ts":"1629771433.252500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UfIEb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a5d8a7c-3c54-46c9-b7c0-d6cd772838a4","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"頭がインドカレーだったのでインドカレーとして聞いてしまいました :pray:\nインドカレーも作るんですね、すごい","ts":"1629771125.249700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CSN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1619a789-0da6-4128-9f3a-2689fb0a905b","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"タイカレーは全然そんなことなくて、ペーストとココナツミルクがあればできるので簡単","ts":"1629771038.248600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LGPCV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b57141b6-8174-4d20-b78d-587511345c68","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"インドカレーは種類使いますね。量はそこそこ\n私作る時はは10種類以上使ってる気がします。","ts":"1629770997.247700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hb4dS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f4e5bbf-4f58-40ed-b7c0-959f72c41982","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"美味しそう！\nインドカレーってスパイス結構使うんですかね？（量、種類）\n\n近所のインドカレー屋さんのカレーがイマイチなのでスパイスで調整したい","ts":"1629770540.244100","thread_ts":"1629719570.240600","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3eXCG"}],"root":{"type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"話の腰折るけどタイカレー(緑)に昨日チャレンジしたのでうｐします、今夜